# uv workflow

## Projects and workspace members

- Create root project: `uv init --name finance --python ">=3.14"`
- Create package member: `cd path/to/member && uv init --package --name <name> --python ">=3.14"`
- Never hand-write a new `pyproject.toml` from scratch

## Dependencies

- Add runtime deps: `uv add --package <member> <package>`
- Link workspace package: `uv add --package api storage security`
- Add dev tools at root: `uv add --group dev pytest ruff`
- Never edit `[project] dependencies` or `[dependency-groups]` by hand

## Lock and sync

```bash
uv lock
uv sync --all-packages   # at repo root; plain uv sync skips workspace members
```

## Allowed manual pyproject.toml edits

- Remove `[project.scripts]` CLI stubs after `uv init --package`
- Add `[tool.fastapi] entrypoint` when the app exists (Part 2+)
- Non-dependency structural config only
